      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Your symptoms likely point to a security breach or compromised device rather than a simple glitch, as automated temperature drops and color shifts usually require active configuration. First, immediately disconnect your smart devices from the internet by switching your router to air‑mode or changing your Wi‑Fi password while monitoring for unauthorized activity. Run a full malware scan on any connected computers and check your router's guest network settings to ensure no unknown devices appear under your network. Once addressed, enable two‑factor authentication on smart home accounts and consider switching to a more secure, isolated IoT network to prevent future unauthorized access.",
