      "content": "that makes sense. i'm gonna try and get those logs. the thing is, i really want to be sure it's not just some coincidence so i can confront them. since the light color changes at 2am specifically, do u think i could write a little script or setting to catch exactly what command is being sent at that time? like if i can capture a log that shows the specific command to change the light color or adjust the temp, it would basically be a smoking gun. can u help me figure out how to automate that kind of logging for my specific devices?",
